@Server.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5090

### OpenAPI document
GET {{Server.Api_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json

### Upload a file
# Replace the file path below if needed.
POST {{Server.Api_HostAddress}}/api/files/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=---------------------------upload-boundary

-----------------------------upload-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="machineName"

MAY-MAI-01
-----------------------------upload-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="manufacturer"

SHIV
-----------------------------upload-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="sentAtUtc"

2026-03-19T15:45:00Z
-----------------------------upload-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample-upload.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

< ./sample-upload.txt
-----------------------------upload-boundary--
